  <item>
    <title>EP11 人在囧途，重生之我在美国睡木板</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e961b33a5ff0a0cafd7e44</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e961b33a5ff0a0cafd7e44</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Sep 2024 11:02:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好久不见，《不裁》终于更新了</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期主要是讲了讲一次不愉快的旅途经历</span></p><span></span><p><span>我真是越来越会扯淡了，这一件事都扯了一期</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是本期内容的时间轴，第一次用，大家见谅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 拖更的第一百三十七个理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 搬家了，这次在纽约</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">04:07</a> 正片人在囧途</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a> 地狱航线，噩梦的开始&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 苏黎世机场，噩梦延续</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">18:28</a> 赛博报菜名，一个果粉的自我修养</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1846">30:46</a> 泪目，终于可以平躺下睡觉了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2386">39:46</a> 再生波澜，中国移动背大锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a> 汇丰、中行，还我钱来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2636">43:56</a> 消失的床垫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3609">1:00:09</a> 日子总会好起来的，对吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的BGM在wyy的歌单，《《不裁》第十一期BGM》&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家过得愉快</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lldXZIvduFq_Mzv6nCZUp09RkNLG.m4a" length="139949029" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:29</itunes:duration>
